<node id="&quot;DESIGNATED BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Borrower that meets specific conditions to receive loans under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Designated Borrower is an entity to which Lenders provide Loans under certain conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Designated Borrower refers to a borrower designated in relation to the Guaranty."&lt;SEP&gt;"A borrower identified by specific criteria in the Loan Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific borrower identified in loan agreements who has distinct borrowing capabilities or restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity designated by the Company to receive funds from the Lenders under the terms of the loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Designated Borrower is an additional Borrower approved by the Administrative Agent and Lenders to receive Loans under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"In the case of any designated borrower that is a foreign subsidiary, nothing in this agreement or any other loan document shall affect any right that the Administrative Agent or any Lender may otherwise have to bring any such action against such Designated Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Designated Borrower is the specific entity within a loan agreement that utilizes the funds provided by the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specific borrower referred to in the contract that holds certain rights and duties under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"each subsidiary of the Company party hereto pursuant to Section 2.14."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3f17cf7a579171d338315f7798375fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ceaf00a3c9eb16269f4ca5175e1da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3e48899c511bd9c1507e3c0453d886</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;U.S. PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDIVIDUAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An entity or individual who qualifies under U.S. regulations, particularly relevant for the appointment of successor Administrative Agents."&lt;SEP&gt;"U.S. Person denotes any person who is recognized as a United States citizen or resident for tax purposes."&lt;SEP&gt;"in the event that a Borrower is a U.S. Person, any Lender that is a U.S. Person shall deliver to the Company and the Administrative Agent..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c</data>
</node>
