</node>
<node id="&quot;ERISA EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to any occurrence that would violate ERISA standards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESIGNATION NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"NOTICE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal communication from the Administrative Agent to the Lenders regarding its intent to resign and the necessary steps to appoint a successor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COUNTERPARTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Provisions related to the execution of the Agreement in multiple copies, constituting a single contract together."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This Agreement outlines the rights and obligations of each Lender in connection with their responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Agreement outlines the terms under which the loan is granted, including conditions for amendments and waivers."&lt;SEP&gt;"This document is referred to as the 'Agreement' governing the terms and responsibilities of the involved parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Five-Year Revolving Credit Agreement dated November 1, 2023, outlines the terms and conditions set forth for the loan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-cd612893d5a0225fd778ba086853009a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3f17cf7a579171d338315f7798375fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab6e4615e53048f9d0e33ad97f0a57e</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOTAL OUTSTANDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL METRIC"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the total amount that is outstanding under the loan agreements and affects borrowing limits."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total Outstandings denotes the total amount of all loans that are currently outstanding at any given time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Total Outstandings represent the total amount of loans that remain unpaid by the Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Total Outstandings refers to the total amount owed under all loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-EXTENDING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A lender that declines to agree to the extension of the maturity date of the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The agreements outlining the terms under which loans will be made to the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT DEMAND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal request from the Administrative Agent for the return of Payments made in error to a Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REPRESENTATIONS AND WARRANTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Assurances made by the parties in the Agreement regarding the truth of certain statements.'</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Loan' is the amount of money that is borrowed and is to be paid back with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Loan is a sum of money borrowed that is expected to be paid back with interest over time."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal agreement in which one party lends money to another, which must be repaid with conditions attached."&lt;SEP&gt;"A sum of money lent to a Borrower with specific terms as stipulated in Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"A type of financial product where the Lender provides a certain amount of funds to the Borrowers under agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Lender severally agrees to make loans (each such loan, a 'Loan')."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan has the meaning specified in Section 2.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans are amounts of money borrowed that must be repaid with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the financial arrangements made by the Company, which require specific compliance with the terms outlined in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the funds borrowed by the Borrower which are subject to repayment terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan represents a financial facility provided by the Lenders to the Borrower as per the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan represents financial assistance provided to the Borrower by the Lenders, governed by the terms outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money that is borrowed, often under specified terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of money that is lent to the Borrower under the terms agreed upon."&lt;SEP&gt;"The financial product that consists of borrowed money that is expected to be paid back with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"a borrowing as defined in the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3f17cf7a579171d338315f7798375fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UK RESOLUTION AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"UK Resolution Authority refers to entities responsible for overseeing the resolution processes for UK Financial Institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An agreement where lenders may purchase shares in the loans of other lenders to share the profit or risk."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFAULT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A situation when a Borrower fails to meet the legal obligations (or conditions) of a Loan, potentially affecting the Lender's rights."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to an event where the Borrower fails to meet the obligations set forth in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to the failure of the Company to meet the obligations defined in the Loan Document, which the Lender can enforce under specific conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Default refers to the failure to meet the obligations stipulated in loan agreements between the Borrowers and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a failure by the Borrower to meet the obligations outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the occurrence of an event that impacts the obligations of the Company, prompting notification obligations to the Administrative Agent and Lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3882e5c61b45ffe53e6ae54b7b7651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CREDIT PARTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Credit Party refers to entities that have lent money or extended credit related to the Guaranty."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SEVERABILITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL PROVISION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal principle that ensures if one part of an Agreement is declared invalid, the rest remains in effect."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER’S PARTICIPATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An arrangement involving a borrower’s consent for lenders to exercise rights of setoff and counterclaim."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BRRD UNDERTAKING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"BRRD Undertaking refers to entities covered under the Banking Recovery and Resolution Directive in the UK and EU."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ALTERNATIVE CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"All payments by the Borrowers hereunder with respect to principal of and interest on Loans denominated in an Alternative Currency shall be made to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Alternative Currency refers to any currency other than the primary currency (usually USD) used in the context of loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any currency other than the US Dollar that may be involved in transactions, relevant for loan provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any currency other than the primary currency used in the agreement, for loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Currencies other than the primary currency used for loan transactions in the interbank market."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any currency used in addition to US Dollars for the purpose of loan transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"any currency other than US Dollars that may be specified in financial arrangements."&lt;SEP&gt;"currencies approved in accordance with Section 1.05, other than US Dollars."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3f17cf7a579171d338315f7798375fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d032810167311fd685322e589a9173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ASSUMPTION AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An agreement that outlines the terms under which one party assumes the obligations of another."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Commitments indicate the agreed-upon amounts that Credit Parties are willing to lend under the Guaranty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Commitments refer to the obligations of Lenders to provide Loans to Borrowers under the Loan Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Promises made by lenders to provide funds to borrowers under specified conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7eb7b5bc404a25d999aedbc8e6f0cac4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE OF SETOFF&quot;">
