<node id="&quot;REGULATORY INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Information required with respect to the Agreement by regulatory authorities under applicable anti-money laundering rules and regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Information that Borrowers must provide to ensure compliance with laws and regulations, including anti-money laundering rules."&lt;SEP&gt;"Information that may be required by lenders to comply with regulations prior to the closing date."</data>
