</node>
<node id="&quot;COMPANY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Company' refers to a legal entity that engages in business activities, as mentioned in various sections of the text."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party in the agreement referred to as the Company that is involved in various financial and legal obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Acts as the guarantor for the Borrowers' obligations under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity defined in the agreement that engages in borrowing activities under specified loan terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Company is mentioned as the entity that may designate additional Borrowers and may request certain agreements and resolutions with Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each of the parties hereto irrevocably and unconditionally agrees that it will not commence any action, litigation or proceeding of any kind against the Company, the Administrative Agent, any Lender or any related party of the foregoing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Reference to an unspecified company involved in financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Referenced as the Company in the context of the Loan Documents and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the Company and its Subsidiaries, which are involved in various financial activities and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the borrower entity that is engaging with lenders and the Administrative Agent for financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the entity that is the primary party in the Agreement, which is seeking to borrow funds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company agrees to certain provisions with respect to the Participants and Lenders in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is defined in the context of the loan agreement as the entity that enters into the Loan Documents and is responsible for obligations therein."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is designated as the agent for giving and receiving notices and handling proceeds of Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is involved in loan agreements and provides financial statements and compliance information."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is the entity borrowing funds under the loan agreement and is responsible for adhering to the terms set forth in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or any Subsidiary fails to pay any Material Indebtedness within five days of the date such payment is due."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company or such Borrower now or hereafter existing under this Agreement or any other Loan Document to such Lender or its Affiliates."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company refers to the entity subject to the terms and obligations of the Guaranty."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company refers to the party that has obligations under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company shall be under no obligation to mark any Borrower Materials 'PUBLIC'."&lt;SEP&gt;"The corporate entity that is subject to the agreements outlined and requires consent for certain financial transactions, particularly those involving assignments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity mentioned that may determine withholding or deduction required by applicable law."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity referred to in a legal context that maintains accounts or provides cash management services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity referred to in the document as 'the Company' is the borrower that is part of the loan agreement described."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity that is the subject of the loan agreement and is seeking to extend the maturity date."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Company' often refers to the business entity that is entering into agreements for borrowing, lending, or other financial activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"means the audited consolidated balance sheet of the Company and its Subsidiaries as of December 31, 2022 and the related consolidated statements of income or operations, stockholders’ equity and cash flows of the Company and its Subsidiaries for the fiscal year then ended."&lt;SEP&gt;"referring collectively to AMAZON.COM, INC. and its subsidiaries in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Company shall deliver to the Administrative Agent or the Administrative Agent shall deliver to the Company..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3f17cf7a579171d338315f7798375fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab6e4615e53048f9d0e33ad97f0a57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ceaf00a3c9eb16269f4ca5175e1da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3e48899c511bd9c1507e3c0453d886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd612893d5a0225fd778ba086853009a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3882e5c61b45ffe53e6ae54b7b7651</data>
</node>
