<node id="&quot;NEW YORK&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"New York is referred to as the jurisdiction governing the interpretation of the Guaranty terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"THIS AGREEMENT AND THE OTHER LOAN DOCUMENTS AND ANY CLAIMS, CONTROVERSY, DISPUTE OR CAUSE OF ACTION ... SHALL BE GOVERNED BY, AND CONSTRUED IN ACCORDANCE WITH, THE LAW OF THE STATE OF NEW YORK."</data>
