<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A set of documents pertaining to a loan, which outlines the terms and conditions applicable to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"All legal documents that outline the terms, conditions, and agreements related to a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents detailing the obligations, agreements, and structures surrounding loans and guarantees."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents that outline the conditions and terms of loan agreements between the lender and the borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents encompass all contracts and agreements relating to loans made by Lenders to Borrowers, outlining terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Documents means this Agreement, each Note, each Designated Borrower Request and Assumption Agreement, each Designated Borrower Notice and the Fee Letter."&lt;SEP&gt;"THIS AGREEMENT AND THE OTHER LOAN DOCUMENTS AND ANY CLAIMS, CONTROVERSY, DISPUTE OR CAUSE OF ACTION ..."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Documents include all agreements and contracts relevant to the lending transaction, outlining terms and responsibilities."&lt;SEP&gt;"The set of legal documents that outline the terms of the lending agreement, including rights and obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"all agreements, documents, and instruments executed by Borrowers and Lenders under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3f17cf7a579171d338315f7798375fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7eb7b5bc404a25d999aedbc8e6f0cac4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ceaf00a3c9eb16269f4ca5175e1da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759</data>
</node>
