  <data key="d2">chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNIFIED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TAXES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Indemnified Taxes consist of any taxes that Borrowers need to pay or indemnify for on behalf of the Recipient or Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indemnified Taxes relate to amounts payable by the Borrowers in relation to payments made to recipients."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes for which borrowers agree to reimburse lenders according to the loan agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that the Borrower may be required to pay related to the loan agreement under specific conditions outlined."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONDITIONS OF BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specific obligations and requirements that must be met before a loan can be granted."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"GUARANTOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Guarantor is an entity that agrees to fulfill the obligations of the Designated Borrower if they default on their payments."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;USA PATRIOT ACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
