  <data key="d2">chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EFFECTIVENESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"the date on which the agreement terms become effective as outlined in the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3f17cf7a579171d338315f7798375fb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CDOR LOAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Loan that bears interest based on the CDO Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MULTIEMPLOYER PLAN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A pension plan to which multiple employers contribute and which is governed under provisions of ERISA."&lt;SEP&gt;"An employee benefit plan that is subject to ERISA regulations and involves contributions from multiple employers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN DOCUMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A formal document detailing the terms under which funds are loaned, including obligations regarding tax withholding."&lt;SEP&gt;"An agreement or document that outlines the obligations of the Company or Borrower to the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any agreement or instrument between the Lender and the Company that governs the loans and obligations under this Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"If not paid, would reasonably be expected to result in a Material Adverse Effect."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Document refers to all documents related to the loan agreement between Lenders and the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Document refers to the various legal documents associated with the loan and its terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Document refers to the written agreement governing the Loans between the involved parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the agreements that govern the loans provided to the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the legal documents governing the transaction, including the rights and obligations of the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document encompasses the formal terms of the loan agreement between the parties, outlining the rights and responsibilities of each party involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document outlines terms and conditions related to the agreement among Lenders and Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loan Document outlines the terms and conditions under which Loans are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"The document refers to the Loan Document in which references appear for lending agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The written agreement outlining the terms and conditions of the loan between the parties involved."&lt;SEP&gt;"This Agreement constitutes a legal, valid and binding obligation of each Borrower that is party thereto in accordance with its terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"any amount of principal of any Loan or interest on any Loan, any fee due hereunder or any other amount payable hereunder or under any other Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"documentation outlining the terms and conditions of a loan between parties."&lt;SEP&gt;"in connection with any Loan Document, and any related losses, claims, liabilities, penalties, interest..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab6e4615e53048f9d0e33ad97f0a57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd612893d5a0225fd778ba086853009a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3882e5c61b45ffe53e6ae54b7b7651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3e48899c511bd9c1507e3c0453d886</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 5.06&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part of the agreement that relates to litigation affecting the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-PUBLIC INFORMATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to information that is shared among parties which may include material non-public information (MNPI)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUD BANK BILL RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark interest rate for Australian dollar bank bills used to set borrowing costs."&lt;SEP&gt;"An Australian benchmark used for financial transactions and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The AUD Bank Bill Rate pertains to Loans or Borrowings denominated in Australian Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Australian Bank Bill Rate used in pricing loans denominated in Australian dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, with respect to any Term Benchmark Borrowing denominated in Australian Dollars for any Interest Period, the AUD Screen Rate at approximately 11:00 a.m., Sydney time, on the first day of such Interest Period."&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate for Australian dollar-denominated loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2d8e7576d4fa2fd6cc2e422f8c5e2f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE IN LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Change in Law refers to any legal modification which may affect the obligations or costs associated with loans or agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any new laws or changes in existing laws that affect the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBSIDIARY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A company controlled by another company, known as the parent or holding company."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any entity that is controlled by the Company, particularly impacting financial and regulatory obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower shall preserve and maintain its corporate existence."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESPONSIBLE OFFICER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An authorized representative of the Borrower who is responsible for executing loan documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"An officer of the company responsible for certifying the conditions of the extension request."&lt;SEP&gt;"Responsible Officer denotes the authorized personnel in charge of delivering specific certifications by a Borrower."&lt;SEP&gt;"Responsible Officer refers to designated executives who are accountable for compliance and notifications in case of a Default occurring."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2d8e7576d4fa2fd6cc2e422f8c5e2f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SECTION 2.14&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Part of the agreement related to the designation of a Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ELECTRONIC SIGNATURES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Digital representations of signatures that are deemed legally binding as per applicable laws."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AUD SCREEN RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"means a rate per annum equal to the average bid reference rate administered by ASX Benchmark Pty Limited (ACN 616 075 417) for bills of exchange in Australian Dollars."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHANGE OF CONTROL&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Events that lead to a new person or group gaining beneficial ownership of more than 50% of the company's equity."&lt;SEP&gt;"There occurs any Change of Control which may trigger various actions under the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A type of borrowing that is subject to term interest rates, providing a framework for how loans are extended and repaid under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowing arrangements that utilize a specific term-based interest benchmark to determine the cost of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Borrowing means various types of borrowing based on benchmarks like Term SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Borrowing refers to borrowings that use a specified benchmark rate, such as Term SOFR."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Borrowings refer to borrowings that are defined by a term benchmark interest rate provided by lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13f8f110a52f456f7cfa34d1627fa44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OVERNIGHT BANK FUNDING RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An interest rate for loans that banks use to borrow from one another overnight, used as a reference for lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate comprised of both overnight federal funds and overnight eurodollar transactions denominated in US Dollars by U.S.-managed banking offices of depository institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LAST FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REPORT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The most recent financial statements provided by the Borrower to stakeholders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;JUDGMENT CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The currency used for the purpose of obtaining judgment in court."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BASE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Base Rate' is a benchmark interest rate used to determine the interest on loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Base Rate is a reference rate used to calculate interest on various loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The minimum rate that serves as the foundation for calculating interest charges."&lt;SEP&gt;"means, for any day, a rate per annum equal to the highest of (a) the NYFRB Rate in effect on such day plus 1/2 of 1.00% per annum, (b) the Prime Rate in effect on such day, and (c) the Term SOFR for a one month Interest Period."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CODE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the U.S. Internal Revenue Code of 1986."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Code refers to the legal framework governing tax withholding and deductions relevant to payments made under the Loan Document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;US DOLLAR EQUIVALENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"STATISTICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The value of an alternative currency represented in US dollars, relevant for financial transactions in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"US Dollar Equivalent refers to the value of currency expressed in terms of US Dollars."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REQUIRED LENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A defined group of lenders that must approve changes to certain agreements under the loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specific group of lenders whose consent is necessary for significant decisions regarding loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A specified group of lenders whose agreement is necessary for certain actions, including the appointment of a successor Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders whose consent is necessary for certain determinations and actions stated in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are the lenders whose approval is necessary for certain actions and decisions pertaining to the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are those lenders who meet a specific threshold and can determine actions such as modifications to loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders are those lenders whose consent is necessary for amendments to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required Lenders refers to a specific group of Lenders whose approval is necessary for certain actions outlined in the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Required Lenders may act with the Administrative Agent in response to an Event of Default."&lt;SEP&gt;"The group of lenders that must agree to extend the maturity date for it to be effective."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3882e5c61b45ffe53e6ae54b7b7651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL COMPLIANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The level of adherence to legal and regulatory obligations by the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREEMENT CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The currency in which the obligations under the Loan Documents are designated."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark interest rate that is used for funding Term Benchmark Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term rate based on the Secured Overnight Financing Rate, used in various borrowing agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR is a benchmark interest rate applicable for some Borrowings."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR is a benchmark rate that is published by the CME Term SOFR Administrator and used for various borrowing agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR is the relevant rate for any Term Benchmark Loan denominated in US Dollars."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term SOFR means a specific rate published by the CME Term SOFR Administrator for US Dollar denominated transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Secured Overnight Financing Rate used as a benchmark for determining interest rates on loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"is the Secured Overnight Financing Rate for a one-month interest period used for various financial transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Secured Overnight Financing Rate for term loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2d8e7576d4fa2fd6cc2e422f8c5e2f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13f8f110a52f456f7cfa34d1627fa44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Commitment' refers to the lender's promise to provide a certain amount of capital as specified in agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the lender's obligation to provide funds to the borrower as specified in the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Commitment of each Lender can be declared terminated if an Event of Default occurs."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of each Lender to provide loans to Borrowers under Section 2.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"The total amount of loans that a lender agrees to provide to the borrower, subject to certain conditions and terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Interest Rate is the percentage at which interest is paid by Borrowers on the amount borrowed from Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The interest rate on a Loan which may be derived from a benchmark that could be affected by regulatory reforms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The percentage at which interest is charged or paid for the use of borrowed money within the terms of the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate at which interest is charged on the loan based on the applicable rates of the lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate at which interest is paid by a borrower for the use of borrowed money."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NON-DEFAULTING LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LENDER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lenders who continue to meet their obligations and are not in default."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN REPAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process through which the Borrower pays back the borrowed funds under the loan agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIAL NON-PUBLIC INFORMATION (MNPI)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INFORMATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sensitive information that could affect the financial performance of borrowers and must be handled according to regulatory compliance."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN ACTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Bail-In Action is a regulatory measure that involves converting unsecured liabilities of an Affected Financial Institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Actions taken under certain conditions to impose losses on lenders to support a failing financial institution."&lt;SEP&gt;"means the exercise of any Write-Down and Conversion Powers by the applicable Resolution Authority in respect of any liability of any Affected Financial Institution."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REVOLVING CREDIT EXPOSURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Revolving Credit Exposure' refers to the amount that a Lender is willing to lend to Borrowers at any one time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the risk exposure that a Lender has towards its revolving credit facility to the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The amount of credit available to a borrower under a revolving credit agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Revolving Credit Exposure of any Lender shall not exceed such Lender’s Commitment."&lt;SEP&gt;"the amount of credit being used by a borrower under a revolving credit facility."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EURIBOR LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Loans denominated in Euro may only be EURIBOR Loans, indicating a specific structure of loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans that are based on the EURIBO Rate, which dictate how interest rates are set for these loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ORGANIZATION DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal documents such as bylaws or certificates that establish the formation and structure of a business entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Organization Documents outline the internal governance and structure of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL CONDITION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The current state of the financial health of the Borrower."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WRITE-DOWN AND CONVERSION POWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Write-Down and Conversion Powers refer to the authority of a Resolution Authority in relation to unsecured liabilities of Affected Financial Institutions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BAIL-IN LEGISLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Bail-In Legislation encompasses laws regarding the resolution of financial institutions through the absorption of losses by stakeholders."&lt;SEP&gt;"means the implementing law, regulation, rule or requirement for EEA Member Countries and the United Kingdom relating to the resolution of unsound or failing banks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERM BENCHMARK LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOAN TYPE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans shall be made upon the applicable Borrower’s irrevocable notice to the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans associated with a specified term and interest benchmark."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans that are determined based on a specific benchmark interest rate over a defined term."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans that are indexed to a benchmark rate for a specified term as outlined in the Loan Notice."&lt;SEP&gt;"Term Benchmark Loans are financial loans that reference a specific benchmark interest rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FINANCIAL INSTITUTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"COMPANY"</data>
