  <data key="d2">chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCHANGE RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Exchange Rate' means on any day, for purposes of determining the US Dollar Equivalent of any Alternative Currency."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OTHER CONNECTION TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TAXES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Taxes imposed due to connections with a jurisdiction based on the nature of the transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INVESTMENT COMPANY ACT OF 1940&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to legislation concerning the registration requirements of the Company, stating it is not required to be registered as 'investment company'."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUALIFIED PROFESSIONAL ASSET MANAGER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Qualified Professional Asset Manager is a professional entity managing asset investments under ERISA guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATURITY DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Designates the final date of loan repayment, subject to extension provisions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maturity Date marks the deadline for the repayment of the Loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date on which the principal amount of a loan becomes due and payable."&lt;SEP&gt;"the date by which the amounts owed under a loan or credit agreement must be fully repaid."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWING MINIMUM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each borrowing of, conversion to or continuation of loans must not be less than the Borrowing Minimum."&lt;SEP&gt;"The minimum amount required for different types of Borrowings as specified in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCLUDED TAXES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Excluded Taxes' means any Taxes imposed on or with respect to any Recipient or required to be withheld or deducted from a payment to a Recipient."&lt;SEP&gt;"Excluded Taxes are specific categories of taxes that may be applicable under certain conditions outlined in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Excluded Taxes attributable to such Lender that are payable or paid by the Administrative Agent or such Borrower in connection with any Loan Document..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Excluded Taxes refers to any taxes not covered under the standard obligations of the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Taxes that are not included in Other Taxes specified in the loan documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</node>
