</node>
<node id="&quot;CLOSING DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EXECUTED DATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The date on which the loan agreement becomes effective and the funds are made available to the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date when all conditions in Section 4.01 are fulfilled or waived."&lt;SEP&gt;"The date when the loan agreement takes effect and the initial loan is executed."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified date on which the loan agreement is completed and funds are disbursed."&lt;SEP&gt;"the date on which the terms of the loan become effective."&lt;SEP&gt;"the date on which the transactions contemplated by the agreement are expected to be completed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWING MULTIPLE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each borrowing of, conversion to, or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans shall be in an aggregate amount that is an integral multiple of the Borrowing Multiple."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified incremental amounts for Borrowings of various types."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
