  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Existing 3-Year Credit Agreement' means that certain Amended and Restated Credit Agreement dated as of March 29, 2022, by and among the Company, the lenders party thereto and JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A., as administrative agent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Note will evidence such Lender’s Loans to such Borrower in addition to such accounts or records."&lt;SEP&gt;"A formal document wherein the borrower acknowledges the debt and agrees to repay according to the specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"A promissory note that evidences a loan made to the Borrower by a Lender, as outlined in the Loan Documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d032810167311fd685322e589a9173</data>
</node>
