  <data key="d1">"'Existing 364-Day Credit Agreement' means that certain 364-Day Revolving Credit Agreement dated as of November 18, 2022, by and among the Company, the lenders party thereto and JPMorgan Chase Bank, N.A., as administrative agent."</data>
