  <data key="d2">chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RELEVANT RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The interest rate used to determine the cost of loans during a specific lending period."&lt;SEP&gt;"the rate applicable to loans denominated in an Agreed Currency as set out in financial agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENTAL AUTHORITY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Governmental Authority' means the government of the United States or any other nation."&lt;SEP&gt;"An authority that determines and enforces applicable laws related to tax compliance and lending."&lt;SEP&gt;"An official body with the power to govern, manage, or regulate aspects related to the loans or entities."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any government entity that may influence or regulate the functions or compliance of financial institutions involved in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any governmental body that issues laws or regulations relevant to the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Governmental Authorities are bodies that impose taxes that the Borrowers may need to withhold or remit under applicable laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the authorities that govern and regulate the Borrower’s operations and compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"any authority established by the government to enforce laws or regulations."&lt;SEP&gt;"claims, liabilities, penalties, interest and reasonable expenses arising from the relevant Governmental Authority..."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING CREDIT AGREEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Existing Credit Agreements' means the Existing 3-Year Credit Agreement and the Existing 364-Day Credit Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Previous loan agreements that must be settled prior to the initial loan from the current agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIALS ADVERSE CHANGE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DEFINITION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A change in the business condition that materially affects financial stability or obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SANCTIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to governmental financial or trade restrictions that the Company and its subsidiaries must adhere to."&lt;SEP&gt;"Restrictive measures imposed by governments or international bodies to achieve foreign policy or national security goals."&lt;SEP&gt;"Sanctions are measures imposed on individuals or entities which the Borrowers must be compliant with according to regulations enforced by government entities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d</data>
</node>
