  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PTE 90-1 is a class exemption concerning insurance company pooled separate accounts."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK REPLACEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A substitute benchmark that takes the place of an existing benchmark in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"A term used to describe a substitute for the current Benchmark as stipulated in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Benchmark Replacement refers to an adjusted rate that replaces an existing benchmark rate."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark Replacement is a predefined interest rate that replaces the original benchmark in the case of unavailability."&lt;SEP&gt;"The condition referring to the replacement of a benchmark in financial transactions to maintain consistency with market standards."&lt;SEP&gt;"replacement benchmarks for interest rates specified within the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the replacement rate that takes effect following a Benchmark Transition Event."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13f8f110a52f456f7cfa34d1627fa44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERMITTED HOLDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT TERM"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The specified group or individuals allowed to maintain ownership as defined in the Change of Control clause."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXISTING MATURITY DATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Existing Maturity Date' has the meaning specified in Section 2.12(a)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The current maturity date of the loan before any extensions are requested."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIENS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LIEN"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A legal right or interest that a lender has in the Borrower's property, granted until the obligation is satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"Legal right or interest that a lender has in the borrower's property, granted until the debt obligation is satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company shall not create or suffer to exist any Lien upon any of its property, assets or revenues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LENDER'S COMMITMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Lender's Commitment refers to the obligations agreed upon by the Lender to provide loan amounts to the Borrowers."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PTE 91-38&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"PTE 91-38 is a class exemption for transactions involving bank collective investment funds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BENCHMARK TRANSITION EVENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event that signifies a change or a shift in the benchmarking standard used in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"An occurrence that indicates a change in the benchmark rates used for borrowing agreements, which may require adjustments in loan terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"an occurrence that triggers the replacement of a current Benchmark with a new Benchmark."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-213102e52aa6edea98697876f4c7a539</data>
</node>
