<node id="&quot;LOANS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Loans' are the amounts of money borrowed under terms agreed upon between the Borrowers and the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amounts of money which are borrowed and to be returned under specified conditions, typically with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans are the amounts borrowed by Borrowers from Lenders according to the terms set out in the Loan Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans refer to amounts provided to Designated Borrowers under the terms set forth in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loans refer to the amounts provided by Lenders to Designated Borrowers under the terms specified in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Loans made by each Lender shall be evidenced by one or more accounts or records maintained by such Lender and by the Administrative Agent in the ordinary course of business."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d032810167311fd685322e589a9173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3e48899c511bd9c1507e3c0453d886</data>
</node>
