</node>
<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Business Day typically refers to any day except weekends and public holidays on which financial institutions are open for business."&lt;SEP&gt;"A day during which business operations are conducted, which can influence loan document terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any day that is not a Saturday, Sunday, or a day banks are closed in New York, with specified variations for currency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any day that is not a Saturday, Sunday, or public holiday, used for calculating time periods in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day refers to any day on which banks are open for business, excluding weekends and public holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Day refers to days when businesses are typically operational and financial transactions are processed."&lt;SEP&gt;"If like payments come due on a day other than a Business Day, payment shall be made on the next following Business Day."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to a regular working day when certain actions, like returning payments, must be completed."&lt;SEP&gt;"Regular working days during which the transactions and communications outlined in the Loan Documents are executed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d032810167311fd685322e589a9173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ANTI-CORRUPTION LAWS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legislation that aims to prevent corruption and bribery in business transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the laws that the Company must comply with to prevent corruption and maintain ethical conduct in operations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d</data>
