</node>
<node id="&quot;INTEREST PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Interest Period defines the duration for which the interest rate remains constant on a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period means the specific time frame during which the interest rate is fixed for a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the duration for which interest applies to each Borrowing."&lt;SEP&gt;"Interest Period refers to the duration over which an interest rate is applied to a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Interest Period is the time duration for which the interest on a loan is calculated and remains constant."&lt;SEP&gt;"The duration during which interest accrues on a loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"The fixed length of time during which interest accrues on a financial instrument."&lt;SEP&gt;"The specified time duration for which a loan is borrowed and interest is calculated."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term defining the time interval for which interest rates are fixed on loans or borrowings."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term that determines the duration for which certain interest rates apply to the loan agreements specified."&lt;SEP&gt;"The timeframe during which interest rates are applied to loans based on benchmark rates."&lt;SEP&gt;"the applicable Borrower wishes to request Term Benchmark Loans having an Interest Period that, pursuant to the definition of 'Interest Period' requires the consent of all the Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13f8f110a52f456f7cfa34d1627fa44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERSON&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"OBLIGOR"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Person' refers to any entity, other than a natural person, engaged in commercial activities."&lt;SEP&gt;"'Person' refers to any individual or entity that has rights and obligations in a legal context."&lt;SEP&gt;"An individual or legal entity capable of entering into contracts and thereby becoming obliged to perform certain actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person is a legal term used to define any individual or entity recognized under law."&lt;SEP&gt;"Person means any individual, corporation, partnership, limited liability company, or other legal entity."&lt;SEP&gt;"The term 'Person' is used to denote any individual engaged in the loan agreement, including borrowers, agents, and others."&lt;SEP&gt;"any natural person, corporation, limited liability company, trust, joint venture, association, company, partnership, Governmental Authority or other entity."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;GUARANTEE OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Guarantee Obligations' has the meaning specified in Section [not provided]."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guarantee Obligations has the meaning specified in Section 10.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"Guarantee Obligations refer to all obligations that the Company guarantees under the terms of the Guaranty."&lt;SEP&gt;"These refer to the obligations guaranteed by the Company for the payment of loans to the Credit Parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</node>
