  <data key="d1">"'Recipient' refers to a party that receives payments or financial benefits under the terms defined in the agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Recipient is the entity receiving payments that may be subject to tax deductions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The entity receiving payments under the Loan Document, which may be subject to tax indemnification agreements with Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Administrative Agent, any Lender or any other recipient of any payment to be made by or on account of any obligation of any Borrower under any Loan Document."</data>
