</node>
<node id="&quot;AGREED CURRENCY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CURRENCY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Agreed Currency refers to the currency in which the loan is denominated, as specified in loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency agreed upon for Borrowing transactions in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency in which syndicated credit facilities are denominated and which may be subject to benchmark adjustments."&lt;SEP&gt;"The currency specified in a contract or agreement used for any financial transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SOFR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'SOFR' refers to the Secured Overnight Financing Rate, a benchmark interest rate for USD loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"SOFR means a rate per annum equal to the secured overnight financing rate as administered by the SOFR Administrator."&lt;SEP&gt;"SOFR stands for Secured Overnight Financing Rate, a broad measure of the cost of borrowing cash overnight collateralized by Treasury securities."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13f8f110a52f456f7cfa34d1627fa44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEBTEDNESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FINANCIAL OBLIGATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Indebtedness' refers to monetary obligations, including loans and credit."&lt;SEP&gt;"Amount of debt or financial obligation that a party owes to another party."&lt;SEP&gt;"Indebtedness means, as to any Person at a particular time, all obligations of such Person for borrowed money and all obligations evidenced by bonds, debentures, notes, loan agreements or other similar instruments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations that might be owed to the Lender from the Company or Borrower, as specified in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the total liabilities owed by the Company, which may influence its ability to create Liens."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ENTITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A person or entity that buys a part of a loan or financial interest from a lender, gaining rights or obligations in that context."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Participant shall be entitled to the benefits of Sections 3.01, 3.04 and 3.05 to the same extent as if it were a Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"a party involved in the loan or financial agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd612893d5a0225fd778ba086853009a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LEGAL"</data>
