  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SONIA&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'SONIA' refers to the Sterling Overnight Index Average, a benchmark for borrowing in Sterling."&lt;SEP&gt;"SONIA means, with respect to any Business Day, a rate per annum equal to the Sterling Overnight Index Average for such Business Day published by the SONIA Administrator."&lt;SEP&gt;"SONIA serves as a benchmark for loans and interest calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Sterling Overnight Index Average for Pound Sterling transactions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c13f8f110a52f456f7cfa34d1627fa44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OBLIGEE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Obligee' refers to a party entitled to receive payment under a contract or agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PARTICIPANT REGISTER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A register maintained by the Lender that records Participants' names, addresses, and their interests in loans or obligations under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Participant Register is a record maintained by Lenders that relates to their participation in Loans and other financial agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"a record of Participants as defined in the loan documentation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd612893d5a0225fd778ba086853009a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Refers to the communication method the Company must use to inform relevant parties of important events, such as defaults or compliance issues."&lt;SEP&gt;"Required communication to the Company by either the Lender or Administrative Agent, regarding actions taken under the Agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d</data>
</node>
