<node id="&quot;GUARANTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Guaranty means the Guarantee of the Obligations of the Designated Borrowers made by the Company in favor of the Credit Parties under Article X."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Guaranty outlines the responsibilities and obligations of the Company with respect to the Guarantee Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Obligations of each Designated Borrower shall be guaranteed by the Company pursuant to the Guaranty contained in Article X."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5f3e48899c511bd9c1507e3c0453d886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-365109d2a10139b03b825bac3b05cc13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024</data>
