  <data key="d1">"An adjustment made to reflect the differences between the old and new benchmarks in the calculations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Benchmark Replacement Adjustment is applied when calculating interest rates based on alternative benchmarks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-bf49c9cb4d9dbf0f5ccdcc32de9179eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0</data>
