</node>
<node id="&quot;TIBO RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INTEREST RATE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark interest rate for loans, though less common than others mentioned."&lt;SEP&gt;"A benchmark interest rate referred to for lending in specific markets."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TIBO Rate is the Tokyo interbank offered rate used for denominating loans in Yen."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TIBO Rate is the relevant interest rate for Loans or Borrowings denominated in Yen."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Thai Interbank Offered Rate used for financial transactions in Thailand."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Tokyo Interbank Offered Rate for loans in Yen."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c2d8e7576d4fa2fd6cc2e422f8c5e2f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d66da8a55a9bfe53a234f03c63fcb1d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85</data>
