<node id="&quot;DEBTOR RELIEF LAW&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"REGULATORY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Debtor Relief Law encompasses legal frameworks designed to protect debtors in financial distress, influencing actions related to default and loan management."&lt;SEP&gt;"Debtor Relief Law includes regulations governing the relief options available to borrowers facing financial distress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laws governing the situation of borrowers facing financial distress or insolvency."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laws that relate to legal proceedings involving Borrowers, particularly in cases of financial distress."&lt;SEP&gt;"Laws under which a Borrower or any Material Subsidiary applies for or consents to the appointment of any receiver or similar officer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Debtor Relief Law governs the rights of borrowers under various circumstances, providing a legal framework for handling loans and defaults."&lt;SEP&gt;"The category of laws that provide relief to debtors, affecting the actions and status of the Lender in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3882e5c61b45ffe53e6ae54b7b7651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759</data>
