  <data key="d1">"A person or entity that has a relationship or connection with another company, which may involve shared ownership or control."&lt;SEP&gt;"Affiliate means any entity controlling, controlled by, or under common control with another person."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that is related to another entity, often through ownership or control, playing a role in the appointment of successor agents or the management of funds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce242614e7c70072950823bb3955e36c</data>
