<node id="&quot;EURIBO RATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BASE RATE BENCHMARK"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A benchmark interest rate often used for loans denominated in euros."&lt;SEP&gt;"The EURIBO Rate is applicable for Loans or Borrowings denominated in Euro."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Euro Interbank Offered Rate used for calculating interest rates on loans in euro."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Euro Interbank Offered Rate, a benchmark for loans within the Eurozone."&lt;SEP&gt;"The euro interbank offered rate, which serves as a benchmark for rates applied to certain loans in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Euro Interbank Offered Rate used in Euro-denominated loans."</data>
