</node>
<node id="&quot;LOAN NOTICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Each Borrowing shall be deemed to be a representation and warranty that the conditions specified in certain sections have been satisfied."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Loan Notice must be received by the Administrative Agent not later than 1:00 p.m., New York City time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Notices specify the details of the loan request made by the Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"Means a notice of borrowing of Loans, conversion of Loans denominated in US Dollars or continuation of Term Benchmark Loans."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8</data>
