<node id="&quot;BORROWERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"'Commitment' means, as to each Lender, its commitment to make Loans to the Borrowers pursuant to Section 2.01."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any failure to so record or any error in doing so shall not, however, limit or otherwise affect the obligation of the Borrowers hereunder to pay any amount owing with respect to the Obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are the entities that receive Loans from Lenders and are obligated to repay under specific terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are the parties involved in the loan agreement that are subject to the terms established in the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each of the Borrowers agrees to certain obligations relating to payments and errors in payments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Individuals or entities who are specified to receive loans."&lt;SEP&gt;"the Borrowers may borrow under this Section, prepay under Section 2.03, and reborrow under this Section."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d66ae22c28cd0d84aa869af9d7f2a233&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b4cc5b2660656388ebad9cd016c596&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a3929bb24620011868bc1e55295803&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d032810167311fd685322e589a9173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab6e4615e53048f9d0e33ad97f0a57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EURIBOR BORROWING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"FACILITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A borrowing structure based on the EURIBO Rate, impacting the conditions under which loans are made."&lt;SEP&gt;"EURIBOR Borrowing refers to loans that are based on the Euro Interbank Offered Rate."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c13f8f110a52f456f7cfa34d1627fa44&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BORROWER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"BORROWER"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A party that receives funds from a lender with the promise to repay the borrowed amount along with interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"A party that takes out a loan under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that receives a loan from the lender with the obligation to repay under specified conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that receives funds from a lender with the obligation to repay under specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"An entity that receives loans from lenders and is obligated to repay them under the terms specified in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any Borrower fails to perform or observe any term, covenant or agreement contained in the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Any entity that borrows money under the loan agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers are entities that request loans and are obligated to repay them as per the agreement terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Borrowers or the Administrative Agent arising therefrom or with respect thereto..."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower is not and will not be using 'plan assets' in connection with the Loans or the Commitments."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower represents and warrants to the Administrative Agent and the Lenders that it is duly organized or formed, validly existing and, as applicable, in good standing under the Laws."&lt;SEP&gt;"Each Borrower represents compliance with the Lender's obligations and the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to any entity that receives loans from Lenders under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to the party that receives funds from the Lender under the Agreement and is responsible for repaying."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the entity receiving loans from the Lender."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower is the party that receives funds from the Lenders under the loan agreement and is responsible for repayment."&lt;SEP&gt;"The person or entity that receives funds from the lender and is responsible for the repayment of the loan."&lt;SEP&gt;"the individual or entity that is receiving funds from the lender."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1677b99670ec966f5fd1919664061d01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-14c8b401e9169305f9280f527d16df01&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f074a2930435362e3f578a0827e759</data>
