<node id="&quot;BUSINESS DAYS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SCHEDULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Business Days are defined periods during which notices and effects of actions can take place according to the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Business Days indicate the days in which the notice periods are calculated, excluding weekends and holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days on which business is conducted, excluding weekends and public holidays, as defined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days on which standard business operations occur, excluding weekends and public holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"Days within which certain financial activities must occur, excluding weekends and holidays."&lt;SEP&gt;"The number of days that are considered 'business days' when determining deadlines or timeframes for various contractual obligations."</data>
