<node id="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"AGREEMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liabilities or commitments that the Borrower must fulfill under the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations owing to such Defaulting Lender as to which it exercised such right of setoff."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the financial responsibilities and commitments that the Company must fulfill under the Guaranty."&lt;SEP&gt;"Obligations refer to the responsibilities and financial commitments of Designated Borrowers as outlined in the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to all amounts due from the Borrowers to the Lenders under the Loan Documents, including principal and interest."&lt;SEP&gt;"Refers to all debts and liabilities of the Borrower arising under the Loan Document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligation of the Borrowers hereunder to pay any amount owing with respect to the Obligations is critical."&lt;SEP&gt;"any amounts received on account of the Obligations shall be applied by the Administrative Agent."</data>
