<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d3">78.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"The Company agrees to the provisions related to the responsibilities of the Lender within the Agreement."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company borrows funds from the Lender and is obligated to repay the funds under the agreement terms."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company engages in financial arrangements with the Lender, providing them with information and financial statements regularly."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company is responsible for guaranteeing the obligations owed by Borrowers to the Lender."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must obtain written consent from each Lender to modify its obligations under the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must provide details of any Default to the Lender."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company obtains funds from the Lender in the form of loans which need to be repaid with interest."|&gt;"Financing"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company receives funds from the Lender under the terms of the loan agreement, making the Lender an essential part of the funding process."&lt;SEP&gt;"The clauses detail obligations and conditions related to loans and assignments involving the Lender and the Company."&lt;SEP&gt;"The obligations of the Company are owed to the Lender or its Affiliates under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"The relationship between the Company and the Lender is defined within the context of financial agreements and obligations."</data>
  <data key="d5">"Consent Requirement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial Agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Financial Obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Lending"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"guaranty"&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;Obligation&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;borrowing&lt;SEP&gt;company-lender&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab6e4615e53048f9d0e33ad97f0a57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd612893d5a0225fd778ba086853009a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ceaf00a3c9eb16269f4ca5175e1da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3882e5c61b45ffe53e6ae54b7b7651&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b187719dac182a293454abdbf819f856</data>
</edge>
