<edge source="&quot;COMPANY&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d3">66.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Company in financial transactions."|&gt;"Agency relation"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Company to manage the agreement and facilitate communication with the Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lenders in facilitating the agreement involving the Company."|&gt;"Agent Role"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent administers the loan on behalf of the Company, ensuring compliance with the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is named alongside the Company in terms of legal responsibilities and actions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages relationships and decisions regarding the Company’s loan agreements."|"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees and enforces compliance with the loan agreement, making it essential to the Company's obligations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees the loan agreements and manages the relationship between the Company and the Lenders."|&gt;"Management and Oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company interacts with the Administrative Agent for various transaction processes and agreements."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must give consent for assignments processed by the Administrative Agent, making them interdependent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must notify the Administrative Agent of any Default occurrence."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company must notify the Administrative Agent regarding an assignment or delegation of rights under the Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Company relies on the Administrative Agent to facilitate communication and compliance for tax obligations under FATCA."</data>
  <data key="d5">"Administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"Agency Role"&lt;SEP&gt;"Agent Relation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Consent requirement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Notification of Rights"&lt;SEP&gt;"Oversight"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Transaction Interaction"&lt;SEP&gt;6&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;Notification&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ab6e4615e53048f9d0e33ad97f0a57e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56136e12e5f98f2b092eac6106feb27e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02ceaf00a3c9eb16269f4ca5175e1da9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3407cac26fbf761cda3f472334e41a85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b1b3dbc667d28f3ba91031c5a47a78d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a887c72da47ff4eea9f79e69a645a7b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f</data>
