  <data key="d4">"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of Lenders and communicates key agreement terms to Borrowers."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is responsible for delivering documentation and managing payment liabilities related to the Borrower... "&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages communications and compliance notifications on behalf of the Borrowers to the Lenders."</data>
  <data key="d5">"Communication Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Intermediary"&lt;SEP&gt;Management</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;ERNISA&quot;">
  <data key="d3">5.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"The Borrower must comply with ERISA standards if involved in employee benefit plans."</data>
  <data key="d5">"regulatory compliance"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c14cd42fa4cdb6464f56e1335cae13d8</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;BORROWER&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d3">46.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Lenders provide funds to Borrowers under the Loan Documents."&lt;SEP&gt;"Lenders represent and warrant compliance for the Borrower's obligations under the Loan Agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower must satisfy the conditions set by the Lender before a Loan Notice can be honored."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrower receives loans from the Lender as defined by the agreement terms."|&gt;"Loan agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Borrowers secure funding from the Lenders under specified conditions and obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides Loans to the Borrowers under the Loan Document, creating a borrower-lender relationship."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides funds to the Borrower as per the loan agreements."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender provides loans to Borrowers, making them responsible for repayment according to the terms outlined in the loan document."&lt;SEP&gt;"The borrower receives loans from the lender and is obligated to repay the loans under the agreed terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"The lender provides funds to the borrower, creating a financial obligation for repayment."</data>
  <data key="d5">"Financial Transactions"&lt;SEP&gt;"Fund Provision"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Funding Relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Agreement"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Obligations"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan Provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"Loan provision"&lt;SEP&gt;"lending"&lt;SEP&gt;"obligation"&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1db9dc3eba353f5566836350c579edfe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f878f9bb708e5f123411182579bddcb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70346a0ac74ecfe6bd503edd172112c0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f</data>
</edge>
