<edge source="&quot;OBLIGATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;">
  <data key="d3">14.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"The Administrative Agent manages and oversees the compliance and payment of all Obligations by the Borrowers."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the application of funds related to Obligations."</data>
  <data key="d5">"Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"management"</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941</data>
