<edge source="&quot;ADMINISTRATIVE AGENT&quot;" target="&quot;LENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d3">110.0</data>
  <data key="d4">"Administrative Agent facilitates communication and transactions between the Lender and Borrowers."|&gt;"agency relationship"&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender agrees to return erroneous payments as instructed by the Administrative Agent, indicating a cooperative relationship."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Lender relies on the Administrative Agent to facilitate and manage the loan processes."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent acts on behalf of the Lender, managing and coordinating transactions related to the loan agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent assists the Lender by managing the loan terms and facilitating agreements related to tax compliance."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent assumes that each Lender will make its share available upon borrowing and manages the records of those Loans."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent coordinates the loan process and notifies each Lender of loan details, indicating a functional relationship."|&lt;&gt;"administration"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent facilitates the assignment process for lenders, maintaining necessary records and overseeing transactions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent has a non-fiduciary role helping facilitate the relationship between the Company and each Lender."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent is involved in arranging and providing services to Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent manages the payment distribution and notifications related to the Lender's activities."|"&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent notifies each Lender about the details of Loan agreements and any changes."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees the agreement and maintains compliance on behalf of all Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Administrative Agent oversees the compliance of the Loan Document and coordinates between Borrowers and Lenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender agrees to notify the Company and the Administrative Agent promptly after any such setoff applies."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender authorizes the Administrative Agent to set off and apply any amounts owing to the Lender under this Agreement... "&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender irrevocably appoints Citibank, N.A. as the Administrative Agent."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender is subject to the authority of the Administrative Agent, establishing a coordination relationship related to loan obligations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The Lender relies on the Administrative Agent for the proper notification and enforcement of rights and remedies as outlined in the loan documents."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"The administrative agent manages the loan agreement on behalf of the lenders, facilitating communication and payment processes."</data>
  <data key="d5">"Agency"&lt;SEP&gt;"Agent role"&lt;SEP&gt;"Agreements and Transactions"&lt;SEP&gt;"Communication"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Coordination"&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;"Facilitation"&lt;SEP&gt;"Management"&lt;SEP&gt;"Notification"&lt;SEP&gt;"Oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;"cooperation"&lt;SEP&gt;"oversight"&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;Authorization&lt;SEP&gt;agent-lender&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;enforcement&lt;SEP&gt;management&lt;</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-abf0317bfac3ae865c4d243bfc139471&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4356ca46805b368884b787be8cbc403&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17156cdb19d248f88d4ee1e387dc4521&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b49249e042a5ea4c6773ec3c7bbc024&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cfb372b965947cb79981661e12746f74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb93392f69f11919011ae9632eeb26aa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-024104f61867a710efed88937d20b566&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-681a8d93f2ef85ce7c68923bd55d27e4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-312f7b4d5463e218d8729ce3bfbd8941&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b57613ab89c368fdc4da998c9b03876f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5f3e48899c511bd9c1507e3c0453d886&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c4b020bf60daa77bdf0578ce86ca311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0a2a3e7203d34544fcfc464c159ad06f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63dba9e522714ac0a8717c04f114cbd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f4d032810167311fd685322e589a9173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd612893d5a0225fd778ba086853009a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3968ce1cdbdbce306c2d8875f076185&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c72ac38860fa8c92501d3a2b3a580efb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca3882e5c61b45ffe53e6ae54b7b7651</data>
</edge>
